<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH INDOOR OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH INDOOR OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>from the $475,000 Czech Indoor Open on Saturday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat 7-Tim Henman (Britain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
